{"defaultLocale":"en-US","id":"MayDay.SnowApp","installers":[{"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"id":"x64-user-nullsoft","installerSwitches":{"Custom":"/currentuser"},"priority":1,"scope":"user","sha256":"99595efb42cb5ff9d85b11c6079fcaec2bd2f5bd56bc81e385694509cb230038","successCodes":[],"type":"nullsoft","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"93d8ffac-9b72-5a71-bb24-eb58c0fee1af"},"url":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/download/v0.5.14/Snow-App-Setup-0.5.14.exe"},{"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"id":"x64-machine-nullsoft","installerSwitches":{"Custom":"/allusers"},"priority":1,"scope":"machine","sha256":"99595efb42cb5ff9d85b11c6079fcaec2bd2f5bd56bc81e385694509cb230038","successCodes":[],"type":"nullsoft","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"93d8ffac-9b72-5a71-bb24-eb58c0fee1af"},"url":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/download/v0.5.14/Snow-App-Setup-0.5.14.exe"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"Developer-focused desktop workspace that integrates AI chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Getting Started","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/en/1-getting-started.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Documentation","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Snow App is a developer-focused desktop application that integrates AI-powered chat, terminal emulation, SSH remote management, Git tooling, and a built-in browser panel into a single unified workspace. It leverages a Rust native module for performance-critical operations such as SQLite storage, AI streaming, file watching, and HTTP requests. Additional capabilities include MCP support, AI image generation, a skills system, hooks, sub-agents, codebase semantic search, and AI-driven terminal sessions.","name":"Snow App","packageUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app","publisher":"MayDay","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/tag/v0.2.3","tags":["ai","chat","codex","git","mcp","ssh","terminal"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"版权所有 (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"快速开始","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/zh-CN/1-快速开始.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Snow App 是一款面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。它通过 Rust 原生模块处理性能关键型操作，包括 SQLite 存储、AI 流式传输、文件监控和 HTTP 请求。此外还支持 MCP 集成、AI 图像生成、技能系统、Hooks、子代理、代码库语义搜索与 AI 驱动的终端会话。","releaseNotes":"新功能\n- 手机 Git 面板增强：支持拉取、推送与 AI 生成提交信息；变更页顶部显示当前分支及 ahead / behind 状态，分支与变更页可左右滑动切换。\n- 检查点开关：通用设置中可关闭检查点。关闭后新会话不再创建文件快照，回退仅恢复会话消息；关闭前需二次确认。\n改进\n- 历史图片按需加载：历史消息中的图片不再还原为 base64，改为从磁盘按需读取，降低渲染进程与主进程的内存占用。\n- SSH 大参数传输：SSH 命令支持通过 stdin 传递大参数，远程文件读取支持大小上限。\n- 移除 OAuth 插件 fetch 接管中的 ensure_fetch_safe 检查。\n修复\n- 终端 MCP 的默认目标与右侧面板的活动标签同步，分屏时点击其他分组的终端不再误判焦点。\n- 关闭隐私过滤总开关后，过滤模式、工具选择与规则配置统一停用，并停止预览显示。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/RELEASE_NOTES_ZH.md#v0514","tags":["ai","codex","git","mcp","ssh","终端","聊天"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf","releaseDate":"2026-11-08","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/tag/v0.2.3","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"0af17